pax_corporations_whatsnew_5_3_1:
• Economic zones on the map look like districts in Cities: Skylines: a union's territory is tinted in its colour and outlined along its member provinces' borders, with a soft band at the edge; the union's name in the middle, a click opens its window. Switch on in the map layers «Corporations» → «Economic zones».
• A long skip (5–10 years) no longer drops FPS to almost zero: while the game skips, weeks are worked off 8 at a time (8 times less work) and a frame gives the mod less time. {игрок:UD8M9CUV}
• The mod's AI no longer slows the game: its requests wait while the game skips and waits for its results, and go every 2 game weeks. {игрок:UD8M9CUV}

pax_corporations_idx_tip_how:
Each part is a logarithm on a 0–100 scale of the world's best company;
the weight is its share of the index. The index sets the world place and the frame
(top 10 diamond, 11–30 sapphire, 31–100 gold, 101–300 silver and the country's leader).

pax_corporations_whatsnew_5_4_8:
• States' goals: every few months each country looks at what it lacks, fears and wants, and acts: arms orders when war is in the air; contracts for the makers of goods it lacks; money for its own technology when your country races ahead; bank rescues in a crisis; backing for its national champion. The decisions move the companies' demand and shares. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• Countries answer your acts: hurt by nationalisation, sanctions or pressure they buy less from your companies; friends place orders with them. Such news always reaches you. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• Random events are 3–4 times rarer: the market moves with the countries' decisions and your acts. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• A new company is built, it does not work at full strength from day one: people, revenue and capacity grow step by step (3 months to 3 years by size and goods); the dossier shows how far along it is. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• Companies with spare money invest it in growth: 6–18 months of building, then more capacity; a big expansion opens a new site at home. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• A headquarters captured in a war: the captor nationalises the company or it falls apart. It can no longer stay a «foreign» company on your land. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• Orders about companies understand the name in any case and by brand: «buy shares of Uniqlo», «buy a stake in the Kurchatov Institute». Before, the name had to be typed letter for letter. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• New Russian companies: Ozon, Rostec, Kalashnikov Concern; Wildberries is now Wildberries (RWB) and is found in orders in Russian too. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• Zoomed out, the companies' buttons and the countries' circles are drawn above the armies. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• The maps of other planets and the Moon no longer show the corporations layer or the economic zones: the companies are Earth's. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• The country rank-up window shows a rectangular flag again. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• The company dossier has a ✕ button to close the window. {игрок:ReD ImPeRoR}
• Before the first week the dossier no longer says «demand $0 · load 0%».
